          "cisco_iosxr": "show policy-map interface <if> input\nshow qos interface <if>\nshow policy-map interface <if> | include dscp\nshow qos interface <if>\nshow policy-map interface <if>\ndebug qos marking\ndebug qos\nshow logging | include QoS\nshow running-config policy-map | match dscp",
          "cisco_iosxe": "show policy-map interface <if>\nshow mls qos interface <if>\nshow policy-map interface <if> | include dscp\nshow mls qos interface <if>\nshow policy-map interface <if>\ndebug mls qos marking\ndebug mls qos\nshow logging | include QoS\nshow running-config | section policy-map | match dscp",
          "mikrotik": "/ip firewall mangle print where chain=prerouting\n/ip firewall mangle print where action=mark-packet\n/queue tree print stats\n/queue simple print detail\n/tool sniffer quick interface=<if>\n/ip firewall mangle print\n/queue type print",
          "fortinet": "show system interface <if>\ndiagnose netlink interface list | grep dscp\ndiagnose netlink interface list\nget system ha status\ndiagnose debug enable\nshow system interface <if>\nshow system global",
