          "cisco_iosxr": "show mpls traffic-eng tunnels\nshow rsvp session detail\nshow mpls traffic-eng topology\nshow mpls traffic-eng tunnels | include bandwidth\nshow mpls traffic-eng topology | include admin\nshow qos interface <if>\nshow policy-map interface <if>\ndebug mpls traffic-eng tunnels\ndebug qos\nshow logging | include QoS\nshow running-config mpls traffic-eng | match bandwidth\nshow running-config policy-map | match dscp",
