          "mikrotik": "/mpls traffic-eng print\n/mpls traffic-eng print detail\n/queue tree print stats\n/queue simple print detail\n/tool sniffer quick interface=<if> filter-port=0\n/tool sniffer quick interface=<if>\n/mpls interface print\n/queue type print",
          "fortinet": "get router info mpls lsp\ndiagnose debug enable\ndiagnose netlink interface list\nget system ha status\ndiagnose sniffer packet any 'rsvp' 4 0 a\ndiagnose debug enable\nshow router mpls\nshow system global",
