          "adtran": "show ip igmp groups\nshow ip mroute\nshow ip pim neighbor\nshow interface <if>\nshow ip igmp interface <if>\nshow ip pim interface <if>\nshow ip mroute <group>\nshow ip rpf <source>\nshow logging | include pim\nshow logging | include igmp\ndebug ip pim\ndebug ip igmp\nshow running-config | section ip multicast-routing\nshow running-config | section ip pim\nshow running-config | section interface"
