          "fortinet": "diagnose netflow status\ndiagnose netflow status | grep packets\ndiagnose netflow status\ndiagnose sniffer packet any 'udp port 2055' 4 0 a\ndiagnose sniffer packet any \"udp port 2055\" 4 0 a\nshow system netflow"
