          "fortinet": "show system interface PW100\nshow system interface | grep mtu\nexecute backup config\n# Atributos de PW no aplican a IPsec; ajustar MTU en interfaz de túnel\nconfig system interface\nedit PW100\nset mtu-override 1500\nnext\nend\nget system interface PW100\ndiagnose ip address list\nshow system interface PW100\ndiagnose debug application ike -1\ndiagnose sniffer packet port1 \"esp\" 4 0 a\nexecute log filter category 1",
